  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "エネルギーを　かたい　けっしょうにかえる　のうりょくで　みを　まもる。テラスタルの　おおもとの　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "에너지를 단단한 결정으로 바꾸는 능력으로 몸을 지킨다. 테라스탈의 근원이 되는 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用將能量變為堅硬結晶的能力來保護自己。是太晶之源的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se protège en transformant de l’énergie en cristal solide. Ce Pokémon est à l’origine du phénomène de Téracristallisation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schützt sich, indem es Energie in harten Kristall umwandelt. Dieses Pokémon ist der Ursprung der Terakristallisierung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se vale de su capacidad para transformar energía en duros cristales para protegerse. Este Pokémon dio origen a la teracristalización.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sfrutta la sua capacità di trasformare l’energia in duri cristalli per proteggersi. Questo Pokémon è all’origine della teracristallizzazione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Terapagos protects itself using its power to transform energy into hard crystals. This Pokémon is the source of the Terastal phenomenon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エネルギーを　硬い　結晶に変える　能力で　身を　守る。テラスタルの　おおもとの　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过将能量变为坚硬的结晶来保护自身。堪称太晶之源的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se vale de su capacidad para transformar energía en duros cristales para protegerse. Este Pokémon dio origen a la teracristalización.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "こだいの　パルデアで　くらしていたがちかくへんどうに　まきこまれてしまいぜつめつしたと　かんがえられていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "고대의 팔데아에 살았으나 지각 변동에 휩쓸려서 멸종된 것으로 여겨져 왔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人們認為牠曾經棲息在古代的帕底亞，但卻受到地殼變動的影響而滅絕了。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vivait à Paldea en des temps reculés. On le croyait disparu, emporté par un bouleversement tectonique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebte im urzeitlichen Paldea, fiel jedoch den tektonischen Plattenbewegungen zum Opfer und galt als ausgestorben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se creía que este Pokémon de la Paldea antigua se había extinguido, víctima de alteraciones en la corteza terrestre debidas a la actividad tectónica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si riteneva che questo Pokémon dell’antica Paldea fosse oramai estinto, vittima dei movimenti tettonici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s thought that this Pokémon lived in ancient Paldea until it got caught in seismic shifts and went extinct.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古代の　パルデアで　暮らしていたが地殻変動に　巻きこまれてしまい絶滅したと　考えられていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人们以前一直认为它们曾生活在古代帕底亚，但因地壳变动影响而灭绝。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se creía que este Pokémon de la Paldea antigua se había extinguido, víctima de alteraciones en la corteza terrestre debidas a la actividad tectónica.",
